// 0 Avatar :
"P765680334" "<f=E4>"
// 6 Desdemona :
"P1434893330" "<color Crimson><bgcolor Black>Vanessa is close. I can feel the remnants of her essence in this room."
// 4 Caption :
"P2255056342" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=4 d=3><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>There! But the mask! Where is the mask?"
// 0 Desdemona :
"P3438938216" "<goto E5>"
// 6 Caption :
"P3696472180" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=7 d=6><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>We have to find it, or all of this will have been for nothing. It must be close to her body!"
// 4 Caption :
"P3976654211" "<x=0.2 y=0.2 t=5 d=4><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>Wait... what was that? I... I don't think we're alone in here!"
// 5 Desdemona :
"P2847629632" "<color Crimson><bgcolor Black>The wall! It's moving! What... what is that monstrosity!?"
// 0 Avatar :
"P774344352" "<f=E6>"
// 1 Avatar :
"P3468473905" "<goto E6>"
// 3.5 Caption :
"P1622235130" "<x=0.2 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>Looks like we're going to have to get that mask the hard way! You want a fight, beast, you got one!"

