// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1463752920" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>Desdemona says: 'The psychic link with Vanessa isn't strong enough for me to pinpoint where she is in this maze of tunnels. I'm going to need to perform some rituals to strengthen the link before we go any further.'<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>I'll be unable to defend myself while I'm performing the rituals, so you're going to have to keep me alive."
// Script Variable BOSS_1ST_DIALOG :
"P1013021009" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>Desdemona says: 'OK. I've got a better sense of where we need to go, but I'm not quite sure which of the exits we need to take.'<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>One more ritual ought to do it. I'll need you to stand guard one more time. Now that the IDF know we're here, I'm sure they'll be coming back!"
// Script Variable BOSS_2ND_DIALOG :
"P3730906686" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>Desdemona says: 'That did it. We have to go through the door to our south. That'll take us into the subway tunnels that'll lead us to Vanessa. Let's go!'"
// Script Variable BOSS_3RD_DIALOG :
"P1752659545" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>Desdemona says: 'What is going on?! It's as though all my powers are drained!'<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>This must be how they caught Vanessa! Quickly! I need you to break me free of this prison before it drains all of my strength away!"
// Script Variable BOSS_4TH_DIALOG :
"P3594961358" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>Desdemona says: 'That was cutting it pretty close. Whatever is going on down here, it looks like both the IDF and the Devouring Earth don't want us to find out!'"
// Script Variable BOSS_5TH_DIALOG :
"P1961765804" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>Desdemona says: 'The spores in the air here are exceptionally toxic. We're going to need to move quickly through here, or the effects will eventually overwhelm us!'"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P856364347" ""

