// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1527646836" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor MidnightBlue>Prometheus says: 'So, Statesman has finally seen fit to get involved in this conflict has he? You should ask yourself what his motivations are? Why has he remained on the sidelines?'<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor MidnightBlue>I have no trust for Statesman. He fears his power, fears becoming like the Emperor. Rather than doing anything about it, he spends his time hiding.<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor MidnightBlue>Unlike him, you are choosing to learn how to wield your power. You are choosing your path. <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor MidnightBlue>You would be wise not to trust him or put your confidence in him... and to keep a close eye on his pet, Desdemona."
// Script Variable BOSS_1ST_DIALOG :

