// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1520634582" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor RoyalBlue>Statesman says: 'The reason you are being sent here is to meet with the Praetorian Vanessa DeVore, a Resistance leader, to bring back a secret so dangerous that Tyrant has eliminated anyone who discovers it.' <t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor RoyalBlue>We must learn this secret before he catches her as well. To that end, I have asked Desdemona to accompany you.<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor RoyalBlue>In the event that DeVore attempts any mental shenanigans, my newest protege's wards will protect you from mental control."
// Script Variable BOSS_1ST_DIALOG :

