// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/P_City_07_07/_src/P_City_07_07_Endgame.xls 	Sheet : ZE_Caption_Vanessa 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P970263289" "<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Vanessa says: 'It seems I have decided to hand over the information just in time. Tyrant has sent the IDF to hunt me down and silence my voice.'<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>I only hope you can get to me first. I am a level or so below you, but I need to keep moving to stay ahead of the IDF."
// Script Variable BOSS_1ST_DIALOG :
"P1078964013" "<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Vanessa says: 'The IDF have forced me deeper into the tunnels, but these don't look like ordinary tunnels. There's something growing on them.'<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>I thought I overheard one of the IDF mention that the Devouring Earth are here. If this is the case, I'm going to have a much harder time getting out of here without your help.<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Hopefully, the IDF and the Devouring Earth will be more focused on fighting each other than dealing with us, but you should be cautious!"
// Script Variable BOSS_2ND_DIALOG :
"P2404012297" "<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Vanessa says: 'I... I have no words. The walls, they are alive. I seem to have stumbled into an infestation of the Devouring Earth, here in the tunnels. They... they are battling with Tyrant's men, so I have some cover to move on.'<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>I will keep moving... I cannot allow either the Devouring Earth or the IDF to find me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_3RD_DIALOG :
"P882703135" "<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Vanessa says: 'No! They've found me. Please, you must hurry!'"
// Script Variable BOSS_4TH_DIALOG :
"P2221087679" "<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Vanessa says: 'Where are you? The Devouring Earth... I'm cornered.... What... what is that!? No!'"
// Script Variable BOSS_5TH_DIALOG :
"P2827934907" "<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Vanessa says: 'Hurry! This... monster! I... I don't think I can hold it off much longer!'"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1916731808" "<t=8 caption x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Indigo>Vanessa's Spirit says: 'It is done. The terrible beast has vanquished me. Your only hope now is to recover my mask. Within it is my consciousness. Recover it and the secret will be revealed. Do not let my death be in vain!'"

