// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 4 Caption :
"P287688689" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>All right. Enough of this. We need to find that mask and get out of here before something else happens!"
// 3 Desdemona :
"P3443024479" "<goto E4>"
// 0 Caption :
"P3992265770" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>I can feel a great power emanating from this mask. It is as though it is alive!"
// 3 Desdemona :
"P728274981" "<f=E1>"
// 7 Caption :
"P2947050869" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=7 d=6><scale 1.75><color Crimson><bgcolor Black>The mask... it... it is sharing Vanessa's knowledge with me... the secret for which she died!"
// 2 Caption :
"P3582957956" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color OrangeRed><bgcolor Black>That... creature we just defeated was an emissary of the Hamidon. It watched Emperor Cole to ensure a promise was kept."
// 6 Caption :
"P2844779243" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=5 d=4><scale 1.75><color DarkOrange><bgcolor Black>The truth is, the Emperor never truly defeated the Hamidon. He negotiated a truce; a chance to prove humanity's worth."
// 6 Caption :
"P1502296066" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color DarkGoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Contact with Primal Earth upset the Emperor's plan. His salvation of humanity would be undone, unless he controlled Primal Earth as well."
// 6 Caption :
"P2533001859" "<x=0.3 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>But the prolonged war rekindled the Hamidon's hatred of humankind, and it is finishing what it began."
// 8 Desdemona_Mask :
"P3731385015" "<color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>The truce is broken. The Hamidon is coming and nothing can dissuade it from devouring all humanity."

