"P2615986821" "<color Crimson><bgcolor Black>Statesman's sent me to make sure we get what we need from Vanessa. Try to keep up, OK?"
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P3440423378" "<color Crimson><bgcolor Black>You're not going to get much further without me. How about you get back here?"
